"clicking the <b>⚙️ icon</b> and selecting a template. This project will allow "
"you to manage all the pre-sales steps, such as:"
msgstr ""
"<b>Za proizvodnjo po naročilu (ETO):</b> V CRM-u ustvarite nov projekt tako, "
"da kliknete <b>ikono ⚙️</b> in izberete predlogo. Ta projekt vam bo omogočil "
